### 课程管理测试

### 1. 创建课程
POST http://localhost:8082/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teacherId": 1,
  "name": "Java程序设计",
  "code": "CS101",
  "outline": "Java基础语法、面向对象编程、集合框架等",
  "objective": "掌握Java编程基础知识和面向对象编程思想",
  "assessment": "平时作业30%，期末考试70%"
}

### 2. 获取所有课程列表
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/list

### 3. 根据用户ID获取课程
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/user/1

### 4. 获取课程详情
GET http://localhost:8082/api/courses/1

### 5. 更新课程
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teacherId": 1,
  "name": "Java程序设计（更新版）",
  "code": "CS101",
  "outline": "Java基础语法、面向对象编程、集合框架、多线程编程等",
  "objective": "掌握Java编程基础知识和面向对象编程思想",
  "assessment": "平时作业40%，期末考试60%"
}

### 6. 删除课程
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/courses/4

### 班级管理测试

### 7. 创建班级
POST http://localhost:8082/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "name": "Java程序设计-2024春季班",
  "classCode": "CS101_2024_SPRING"
}

### 8. 获取教师的班级列表
GET http://localhost:8082/api/classes/teacher/1

### 9. 获取学生的班级列表
GET http://localhost:8082/api/classes/student/3

### 10. 获取班级详情
GET http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1

### 11. 学生加入班级
POST http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/join/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1001
}

### 12. 通过班级代码加入班级
POST http://localhost:8082/api/classes/join?classCode=CS101_2024_SPRING&studentId=1002

### 13. 获取班级学生列表
GET http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/users

### 14. 学生退出班级
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/leave/1001

### 15. 添加单个学生到班级
POST http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/students?studentId=1003

### 16. 从班级移除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/remove-student?userId=1003

### 17. 获取班级学生数量
GET http://localhost:8082/api/classes/1/student-count

### 课程章节管理测试

### 18. 创建课程章节
POST http://localhost:8082/api/course-sections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "第一章 Java基础语法",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### 19. 获取课程的所有章节
GET http://localhost:8082/api/course-sections/course/1

### 20. 更新课程章节
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/course-sections/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "第一章 Java基础语法（更新版）",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### 21. 删除课程章节
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/course-sections/1

### 学生导入测试

### 22. 导入学生到班级
POST http://localhost:8082/api/imports/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 1,
  "operatorId": 1,
  "fileName": "students.xlsx",
  "importType": "EXCEL",
  "studentData": [
    {"studentId": "2024001", "studentName": "张三"},
    {"studentId": "2024002", "studentName": "李四"},
    {"studentId": "2024003", "studentName": "王五"}
  ]
}

### 23. 获取班级的导入记录
GET http://localhost:8082/api/imports/class/1

### 24. 获取导入记录详情
GET http://localhost:8082/api/imports/1
